            "review_title": "Review at Oat Bistro",
            "review_text": "Jonathan M\nTotnes, United Kingdom28 contributions\n0\nThe best vegetarian food in Vietnam!\nDec 2024 • Couples\nThis really is a hidden gem - such a fantastic restaurant! My wife and I were looking for vegetarian food in Ha Long Bay and we couldn't believe it when we found the Oat Bistro. We ate here twice and it has been the best food we have had since being in Vietnam. The staff are lovely, the food is very good value - go if you can! 😋\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 24, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
