            "review_title": "Review at Oat Bistro",
            "review_text": "Melissa N\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing food\nSep 2024 • Family\nThis place is a hidden gem. The food is so delicious. It is vegetarian but the flavours are so full. We loved every mouthful. And the staff are so welcoming and helpful. Go for a meal, you will be wowed!\nInsider tip:\nIt would not matter what you tried on the menu, judging by the dishes we tried everyone of them were flavoured to perfection.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 24, 2024",
